<title>USA: Worthington names its CEO as chairman.</title>
<headline>Worthington names its CEO as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBUS, Ohio 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Worthington Industries said on Thursday it named Chief Executive Officer John P. McConnell as company chairman.</p>
<p>He replaced his father, John H. McConnell, who would assume the title of founder and chairman emeritus, Worthington said in a statement.  </p>
<p>John H. McConnell would remain on the board as a director and as chair of the executive committee.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
